// REJECTS: Unexpected token '"'
//
// Pure string literals are SINGLE-quoted. A double-quoted string is not an alternative
// spelling -- '"' is not a string delimiter anywhere in the language, which is why the
// error is on the quote character itself rather than on the content.
//
// Text is the right place to pin it: `content:` holds free prose, prose contains
// apostrophes, and a rewrite that adds double quotes as an escape-free convenience for
// exactly that reason makes every Text element it writes unreadable to legend-engine while
// reading its own output back perfectly.
###Text
Text fixture::neg::DoubleQuoted
{
   type: 'plainText';
   content: "double quoted body";
}
